    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to Hieronymus.
* Travel to the Beastmen Ensign at (G-12) in {z:Grauberg}.
** Party of 3 or greater required.
* Once the party leader has selected to enter, you will be transported into {z:Ruhotz Silvermines}.
* You'll start out at (J-7). Head to the intersections at (I-8). The southern path looks like it leads somewhere, but is actually a dead-end. Instead, head north where there will be a few {m:Bronze Quadavs|Bronze Quadav}. Wipe them out as you see fit (Sleep to handle the inevitable links is highly reccomended) and head to the west, where you'll find stronger {p:Iron Quadavs|Iron Quadav}. Again, defeat these {m:Quadav}, and head down the stairs where you'll find some {p:Iron Quadavs|Iron Quadav} mixed in with some {m:Darksteel Quadavs|Darksteel Quadav}.
* To complete this operation, you need to meet a minimum requirement of war results, the war results tally is displayed after each kill.
** Killing a {m:Bronze Quadav} or a {m:Brass Quadav} increments your Soldiers count.
** Killing a {p:Iron Quadav} or a {m:Steel Quadav} increments your Enlistees count.
** Killing a {m:Darksteel Quadav} increments your Officers count.
* When the completion requirements are met, "Operation Complete" message will be printed in the logs.
* Must exit area using the Twilight Aureola for {n:Hieronymus} to acknowledge the mission as successful.
* Return and talk to Hieronymus for your reward.

=2 Notes
Can be cleaved quite comfortably with a reasonably geared BLU. Campaign Operation becomes available after completing Pit Spider I (B)
